  "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiotic_projection_1",
  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the elderly Black man as the recipient of the insult",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the recipient of the meme's message — the elderly Black man — who is being addressed with the text 'good morning sleepyhead'. The term 'sleepyhead' is used condescendingly, and the user is positioned as the one delivering the mocking greeting, thereby projecting themselves onto the scene as the speaker or the one who is waking up the 'sleepyhead'. The visual material of the man is the target of the projection, as the user imagines themselves as the one who is 'waking up' or 'talking to' him in a demeaning way. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'elderly_black_man' and the Scene entity 'text_overlay_scene', which frames the man as the object of the user's address.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
